unt" href=3D"https://www.adobe.com/go/acctmgmt_plan" target=3D"_blank">Adob=
e Account</a> page or by contacting <a class=3D"customer_support" href=3D"h=
ttps://www.adobe.com/go/csupport_subscripterms" target=3D"_blank">Customer =
Support*</a>. If you cancel within 14 days of your initial order, you=E2=80=
=99ll be fully refunded. Should you cancel after 14 days, your payment is n=
